       •  LLCC__NNUUMMEERRIICC

       •  LLCC__TTIIMMEE

       In  addition, since glibc 2.2, the GNU C library supports the following
       nonstandard categories:

       •  LLCC__AADDDDRREESSSS

       •  LLCC__IIDDEENNTTIIFFIICCAATTIIOONN

       •  LLCC__MMEEAASSUURREEMMEENNTT

       •  LLCC__NNAAMMEE

