              ters.   Characters also specified as uuppppeerr, lloowweerr, aallpphhaa, ddiiggiitt,
              ggrraapphh, or xxddiiggiitt  are  not  allowed.   The  characters  <<ssppaaccee>>,
              <<ffoorrmm‐‐ffeeeedd>>, <<nneewwlliinnee>>, <<ccaarrrriiaaggee‐‐rreettuurrnn>>, <<ttaabb>>, and <<vveerrttiiccaall‐‐
              ttaabb>> are automatically included.

       _c_n_t_r_l  followed by a list of control characters.  Characters also spec‐
              ified  as  uuppppeerr,  lloowweerr,  aallpphhaa, ddiiggiitt, ppuunncctt, ggrraapphh, pprriinntt, or
              xxddiiggiitt are not allowed.

       _p_u_n_c_t  followed by a list of punctuation characters.   Characters  also
              specified  as  uuppppeerr, lloowweerr, aallpphhaa, ddiiggiitt, ccnnttrrll, xxddiiggiitt, or the
