              pphhaa, ddiiggiitt, xxddiiggiitt, and ppuunncctt are automatically included.  Char‐
              acters also specified as ccnnttrrll are not allowed.

       _p_r_i_n_t  followed by  a  list  of  printable  characters,  including  the
